            "review_text": "THANH LAM\n2 contributions\n1\nHoliday season\nJan 2020 • Friends\nThe Colour has amazing spaces for beautiful pics if you’re interested in saving memories with images. Foods are fantastic with many options and reasonable prices so worth a try guys. Another thing is I get a beer offer that matches my reference and emotion. So cool that makes me speechless. What a great way The Colour creates my experience. Along with promotion and happy hour they offer, I think this cool place will be my number one to go to.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 19, 2020",
