            "review_text": "BluePhilG\nUbud, Indonesia38 contributions\n0\nSuperb choice of craft beer\nJan 2020\nSuperb choice of craft beer reasonably priced. Offer small sizes too, 175ml. Happy Hour was only for a single beer, which was good but not great, and I’m tempted to mark down half a mark for that.\nNuts with beer tho too ;)\nGive it a visit!\nWritten January 14, 2020\nTHE COLOUR - CRAFT BEER\nIt was great for you to visit us. Don't worry, every day we choose a different delicious beer for happy hours. We hope you will come back to try more of our carefully selected craft beers. Thank you with love <3\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
